    "通过 iPhone 操作按钮或底部麦克风启动快速录音时，将默认按此去向处理。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Quick recordings started from the iPhone Action Button or bottom microphone will use this destination by default." } }, "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "通过 iPhone 操作按钮或底部麦克风启动快速录音时，将默认按此去向处理。" } } } },
    "绑定 iPhone 操作按钮（Action Button）" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Bind iPhone Action Button" } }, "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "绑定 iPhone 操作按钮（Action Button）" } } } },
    "打开系统「设置 → 操作按钮 → 快捷指令」，选择「VoxPocket · 开始录音」，即可随时按一下实体键极速录入语音。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open Settings → Action Button → Shortcut, and choose 'VoxPocket · Start Recording' for one-press voice capture." } }, "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "打开系统「设置 → 操作按钮 → 快捷指令」，选择「VoxPocket · 开始录音」，即可随时按一下实体键极速录入语音。" } } } },
